# Restorable/regenerated content (clones via `omarchy plugin clone`) —
# except taeryn.menu (back button, rofi keys — live SUPER+SPACE menu),
# taeryn.clipboard (rofi keys matching the menu — SUPER+C overlay),
# taeryn.notifications (+ msg-incoming.mp3 sound on new popups) and
# taeryn.image-picker (C-j left / C-k right in the background switcher).
# taeryn.indicators (click-toggle chevron drawer) is a clone with real
# customizations. taeryn.glassgame, taeryn.webapps, taeryn.capture
# (touch screenshot picker) and taeryn.webcam (ffplay toggle) are own
# bar widgets, not restorable clones.
.config/omarchy/plugins/*
!.config/omarchy/plugins/taeryn.menu/
!.config/omarchy/plugins/taeryn.clipboard/
!.config/omarchy/plugins/taeryn.notifications/
!.config/omarchy/plugins/taeryn.image-picker/
!.config/omarchy/plugins/taeryn.glassgame/
!.config/omarchy/plugins/taeryn.webapps/
!.config/omarchy/plugins/taeryn.indicators/
!.config/omarchy/plugins/taeryn.capture/
!.config/omarchy/plugins/taeryn.webcam/
.config/omarchy/*.bak.*
.config/wlogout/colors.css
__pycache__/
*.pyc
